# phenodocs vendor placeholder

This file replaces a previously-committed absolute symlink
(`docs/vendor/phenodocs/packages/docs` -> `/Users/kooshapari/CodeProjects/Phenotype/repos/libs/crates/phenodocs/packages/docs`)
that was a local development path on a single contributor's machine and broke
the `release-plz` workflow on every CI run:

    ERROR cannot copy directory "<repo-root>" to Utf8TempDir
    Caused by:
        0: cannot strip prefix "<repo-root>" from
           "/Users/kooshapari/CodeProjects/Phenotype/repos/libs/crates/phenodocs/packages/docs"
        1: prefix not found

Submodule `phenodocs` (path `phenodocs`) is the upstream source of those docs;
this placeholder preserves the `docs/vendor/phenodocs/packages/` tree shape so
historical references and existing build steps that look for it keep working
without depending on a contributor-local absolute path.
